  "name": "etool",
  "description": "A multi-target local persistence utility utilizing the SwiftData framework and SwiftUI to manage relational data models across the Apple platform family. The architecture emphasizes a unified schema definition and reactive state management for synchronized entry logging on mobile, desktop, and wearable environments. The project integrates standard XCTest suites for both unit and UI verification across disparate hardware targets.",
